{
  "name": "Competitor Spy Bot \u2014 Siva",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Competitor Spy Bot \u2014 Siva\nMondays 09:00: scrape each competitor's pricing, blog and jobs pages, diff vs last snapshot, Gemini summarises what changed and why it matters. Slack digest only after human approval.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "eca0629a-0bb2-494c-b41f-e125dbba76b9",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2014 Flow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "MEMORY LAYER (no live DB): the Competitor Snapshots sheet IS the memory \u2014 one row per competitor per week (pricing_text, blog_latest, jobs_latest, hash). Diff node compares the new fetch hash vs the last row. A Postgres/vector store can replace the sheet later; do not invent a live DB connection.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "0a0d7b6d-4d15-45e4-8b5f-143fb864f3f4",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2014 Memory Layer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "CREDENTIALS NEEDED (pick/create on import \u2014 no credential is set in this file):\n- Google Sheets (OAuth2) \u2014 Get Competitor List, Save Snapshot, Log Error to Sheet, Log Execution\n- Slack API \u2014 Send Approval Digest, Send Monday Digest, Notify on Error\n- Google Gemini (PaLM) API \u2014 Gemini Chat Model",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "59b095c8-c114-4871-93ce-09c4b83f4878",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2014 Credentials",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * 1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "bfc0a5c6-923c-42b3-80d9-fa5dcdbf5977",
      "name": "Monday 9am",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": "YOUR_COMPETITOR_SHEET_ID",
        "sheetName": "Competitors"
      },
      "id": "f1b68e14-c709-49aa-a04e-5c5b50198b31",
      "name": "Get Competitor List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f5a7cd27-5225-424d-8c48-3c94b64c1777",
      "name": "Split Competitors",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.pricing_url }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "f742c76c-b82d-4e4b-b9e9-14c2f9b9ce70",
      "name": "Fetch Pricing Page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.blog_url }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "d3e91123-7f76-4204-80b0-4b21519365f1",
      "name": "Fetch Blog Page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.jobs_url }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "4849309e-e338-4645-bf5a-72c01b93e88b",
      "name": "Fetch Jobs Page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Compare fetched page text hash vs last snapshot row (passed in via $json.last_hash).\nconst text = JSON.stringify($json); let h = 0; for (const c of text) h = (h * 31 + c.charCodeAt(0)) >>> 0;\nreturn [{ json: { competitor: $json.competitor_name, new_hash: String(h), last_hash: $json.last_hash || '', changed: String(h) !== String($json.last_hash || ''), pricing_text: ($json.pricing_text || '').slice(0, 4000), blog_latest: ($json.blog_latest || '').slice(0, 2000), jobs_latest: ($json.jobs_latest || '').slice(0, 2000) } }];"
      },
      "id": "bc2dd5b1-42d8-412f-93ce-57473ab3243f",
      "name": "Diff vs Last Snapshot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gemini-2.0-flash",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "89c4876b-a95c-4504-a149-2e857bda4ebd",
      "name": "Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1680,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Summarise what changed for {{ $json.competitor }} (changed={{ $json.changed }}). Pricing: {{ $json.pricing_text }}. Blog: {{ $json.blog_latest }}. Jobs: {{ $json.jobs_latest }}. Explain what changed and why it matters to Siva (AI SDR / LangGraph agent builder). No invented prices \u2014 only report what is in the fetched text.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You summarise competitor changes from fetched page text only. Never invent a price, feature or job. If nothing changed, say so in one line."
        }
      },
      "id": "dfd9ea6c-1d7c-4341-890a-65fe69f8d1af",
      "name": "Summarise Changes (Gemini Agent)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [
        1680,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": "YOUR_COMPETITOR_SHEET_ID",
        "sheetName": "Snapshots",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "week": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "competitor": "={{ $json.competitor }}",
            "new_hash": "={{ $json.new_hash }}",
            "changed": "={{ $json.changed }}",
            "summary": "={{ $json.output }}"
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "8a7bde5c-2392-47d5-9309-bcf4cbe19985",
      "name": "Save Snapshot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [
        1920,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.changed }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true
      },
      "id": "995061ae-c040-4c78-a482-3c73d122ff6b",
      "name": "Changed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        2160,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "postMessage",
        "channel": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID",
        "text": "=Competitor changes draft for {{ $json.competitor }}:\n{{ $json.output }}\nReply APPROVE to send the Monday digest, or REJECT to skip. Nothing is posted publicly until approved.",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "c3b52889-8b78-4f9e-9371-ad6a07f8ed5c",
      "name": "Send Approval Digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2400,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 4,
        "unit": "hours"
      },
      "id": "269b5287-91cb-418f-85d2-2e26571d85ad",
      "name": "Wait for Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        2640,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.approved }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true
      },
      "id": "30f30404-c893-4894-90c7-48b2ccfc5268",
      "name": "Approved?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        2880,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "postMessage",
        "channel": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID",
        "text": "=Monday competitor digest (approved):\n{{ $json.output }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "f191faab-cf27-4d61-bce6-a0825b2b3d0c",
      "name": "Send Monday Digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        3120,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e88fc20e",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "skipped \u2014 not approved",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "85770d85",
              "name": "reason",
